('litvinenko-inquiry', 'Part 10: Summary of conclusions', '10-6-medical-cause-litvinenko', '245', '10.6 As to the medical cause of Mr Litvinenko''s death, I am sure of the following matters:'),
('litvinenko-inquiry', 'Part 10: Summary of conclusions', '10-7-there-abundant-evidence', '245', '10.7 There is abundant evidence that Mr Litvinenko met Andrey Lugovoy and his associate'),
('litvinenko-inquiry', 'Part 10: Summary of conclusions', '10-8-i-am-sure', '245', '10.8 I am sure that Mr Litvinenko ingested the fatal dose of polonium 210 whilst drinking tea in the Pine Bar of the Millennium Hotel during the afternoon of 1 November 2006.'),
