('uk-leveson-inquiry', 'PRACTICES AND ETHICS OF THE PRESS', 'department-culture-media-sport-1351-3', '995', 'the Department for Culture, Media and Sport — 1351 6 News Corp and the Rt Hon Alex Salmond MSP — 1407 Chapter 7: Further political perspectives on relationships with the press — 1414 1 Introduction — 1414 2 The Deputy Prime Minister, the Rt Hon Nick Clegg MP — 1414 3 The Leader of the Opposition, the Rt Hon Ed Miliband MP — 1416 4 The First Minister of Scotland, the Rt Hon Alex Salmond MSP — 1418 5 The Rt Hon Kenneth Clarke QC MP — 1423 6 The Rt Hon Michael Gove MP — 1425 7 The Rt Hon George Osborne MP — 1427 Chapter 8: Conclusions and Recommendations — 1428 1 Introduction — 1428 2 The proprietors — 1430 3 ''Too close'' a relationship — 1438 4 Existing regulatory framework — 1446 5 Recommendations for future relations between politicians and the press — 1451'),
