('uk-leveson-inquiry', 'PART I CHAPTER', 'right-honourable-gordon-brown-mp', '1957', 'The Right Honourable Gordon Brown MP: • list of meetings with the media, http://www.levesoninquiry.org.uk/wp-content/ uploads/2012/06/Exhibit-GB3-to-Witness-Statement-of-Gordon-Brown-MP.pdf'),
